An investment of $2,000 earns simple interest at an annual rate of 5% for 3 years. At the end of year 3, the total amount (original principal plus all interest earned so far) is reinvested at a simple annual interest rate of 4% for 2 more years. What is the final amount, in whole dollars, at the end of year 5?

